{"pageProps":{"story":{"name":"Taktsoft.Energy Journey Builder","created_at":"2025-07-17T13:47:16.234Z","published_at":"2025-12-08T13:13:44.667Z","updated_at":"2025-12-08T13:13:44.688Z","id":69920514616877,"uuid":"2e4bb5bc-7b20-4265-a5bc-6e327e9066a7","content":{"_uid":"0a50eb47-353c-43a7-93b9-c65698e87178","type":"page","section":[{"_uid":"21bbd375-adee-429f-843b-7b47fa855e4b","type":"section","style":"","width":"full","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Der digitale Booster für Energieversorger mit nahtloser Editor-Erfahrung","_uid":"6cd9a90c-d8b3-43cc-b327-2d9a74c4d005","text":"Taktsoft.Energy entwickelt, betreibt und vermarktet ein einzigartiges E-Commerce-Ökosystem für den Energiemarkt. Gemeinsam haben wir eine innovative Anwendung auf der Backend-Lösung von Energy Cloud entwickelt, mit der EVUs oder Stadtwerke nahtlos interaktive Buchungsstrecken, Kundenportale und Landing Pages erstellen können.","type":"hero","height":"default","buttons":[],"overlay":true,"textbox":true,"headline":"Taktsoft.Energy Journey Builder","component":"hero","image_alt":"Komposition verschiedener Screenshots aus der Anwendung, die durch den Raum schweben","colorNeutral":false,"image_indent":"","textPosition":"below","highlightText":true,"image_srcMobile":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/4015x2000/6459e6b4a6/iso_1_rectangle.png","image_srcTablet":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/4015x2000/6459e6b4a6/iso_1_rectangle.png","image_srcDesktop":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/4015x2000/6459e6b4a6/iso_1_rectangle.png"}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"6f5d486b-5abc-4b36-8e53-ca352ebc3409","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"Ein skalierbares und performantes Frontend, welches potentiell jedes Branding aus dem Energiemarkt annehmen kann","_uid":"9a0c0324-de99-411f-b93f-2a88ecf25a9f","text":"Taktsoft.Energy benötigte ein skalierbares White-Label Design System, um die sehr individuellen Anforderungen der Kunden aus der Energiewirtschaft über ein zentrales Cloud Ökosystem mit API-Gateway zu SAP, epilot und anderen, auch die Frontend-Prozesse optimal zu streamlinen.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Große Herausforderungen","component":"cta","fullWidth":false,"image_alt":"","textAlign":"center","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true},{"_uid":"8fe971f6-f331-4037-8cc1-0f3f39afe046","type":"features","style":"besideSmall","layout":"largeTiles","feature":[{"_uid":"cd1150d4-93ea-49cc-a779-e8dda9a2d916","icon":"compass","text":"wollen ihre Produkte möglichst in ihrem eigenen Look and Feel und entlang ihrer persönlichen Customer Journey verkaufen. ","type":"feature","style":"stack","title":"EVU, Stadtwerke und Energieunternehmen","component":"feature","cta_label":"See more","cta_style":"link","cta_target":"#","cta_toggle":false},{"_uid":"7623876d-89a8-4037-bc60-d2c3a8196561","icon":"multi-channel","text":"Es war entscheidend, eine flexible Plattform zu schaffen, die offen für die Integration neuer Schnittstellen ist und den dynamischen Anforderungen der schnelllebigen Energiebranche gerecht wird.","type":"feature","style":"stack","title":"Offene, flexible Plattform, API-ready","component":"feature","cta_label":"See more","cta_style":"link","cta_target":"#","cta_toggle":false},{"_uid":"aa42c2d8-e6e2-402d-ad3b-441205f16a5b","icon":"layout","text":"Redakteur:innen sollten in die Lage versetzt werden, selbst komplette Buchungsstrecken, Kundenportale oder Landing Pages zu erstellen.","type":"feature","style":"stack","title":"Einfaches Aufsetzen von Customer Journeys","component":"feature","cta_label":"See more","cta_style":"link","cta_target":"#","cta_toggle":false}],"component":"features","ctas_style":"link","ctas_toggle":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"none","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"accent","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"215bd12c-3d6d-4512-8921-7e715e40f81f","type":"section","style":"","width":"max","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"3c538838-9380-41ca-8159-43c41c204349","text":"Die sog. „Experience Engine“ bietet eine Headless-Plattform, mit der Energieversorger vollständig anpassbare, White‑Label-Buchungsstrecken („Journeys“) erstellen können. Das Backend läuft auf Energy Cloud, ergänzt durch ein flexibles Frontend mit **MUI-Editor**, **Sanity CMS** (für redaktionelle Inhaltsblöcke) und **kickstartDS** (zur Darstellung und Multibranding). \n\nSo entsteht ein modularer, gestaltbarer Baukasten für Endkunden-Buchungen ohne Einbußen bei Corporate Identity oder User Experience.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Lösung und Vorgehen","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Screenshot aus dem Editor UI des Energy Journey Builders","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2000x1344/40fd53a35e/exe-02.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true},{"sub":"","_uid":"29881239-8f7a-4df7-8d7f-931509cb8b72","text":"Wir verfolgten einen klar strukturierten Ansatz, um einen leistungsstarken und flexiblen **Journey‑Builder** zu schaffen. Zuerst haben wir uns für eine Headless-Architektur entschieden: Das Backend basiert auf encore Cloud und verwaltet Logik, Datenstrukturen und APIs getrennt vom Frontend. ","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Wie nutzen Redakteur:innen den Editor","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Screenshot aus dem Editor UI des Energy Journey Builders","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2000x1346/affbee3259/exe-01.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":false,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":false},{"sub":"","_uid":"c4f7cc38-84b7-4d2c-9a7b-2cf0d9c3809c","text":"Das Frontend besteht aus einem MUI-basierten WYSIWYG-Editor mit **Live-Preview,** der es Nutzer:innen ermöglicht, intuitiv eigene Buchungsstrecken zu gestalten. \n\nDie Einbindung von **Sanity CMS** ermöglicht es, benutzerdefinierte Inhaltsblöcke für Texte, Bilder und Formulare zu konfigurieren, innerhalb vordefinierter CI-Grenzen. Jeder Inhaltsblock lässt sich bequem ziehen, ablegen und editieren.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Screenshot einer mit dem Editor UI des Energy Journey Builders erstellten Buchungsstrecke","image_src":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/2000x1344/9f90e9a93c/exe-03.png","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":false,"image_padding":true,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"none","spaceBefore":"none","content_mode":"list","headline_sub":"","content_align":"","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"none","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"52add920-07c4-47fa-bff0-6bbc3fd82b7f","type":"section","style":"","width":"default","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"6bda06ca-221d-412d-89c8-294349ad4049","text":"**Design System Services**\n\n- Interface & UX-Design\n- Technische Konzeption \n- Frontend-Entwicklung ","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"1f5aff21-1426-4a85-9ba3-300fdf6aed90","text":"**Technologien**\n\n- [Sanity CMS](/headless-cms/sanity-websites)\n- [kickstartDS](/design-system-services/design-system-starterkit-kickstartds)\n- [Storybook](/glossar/storybook)\n- MUI, React, Next.js","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true},{"_uid":"49643075-f542-4da5-9100-d3acb1406a19","text":"**Weiterführende Artikel**\n\n- **YouTube**: [Next-level editorial experiences](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=00iepYPbQII) \n- [Composable Frontends](/headless-cms/composable-frontends)","type":"image-text","layout":"","component":"image-text","image_alt":"","highlightText":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":""},{"_uid":"52b4584f-97f1-4604-b795-abfaf72ec91a","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"sub":"","_uid":"4d94e53e-6014-49ab-9690-e4ea4af3958f","text":"Mit der Umsetzung des Energy Journey Builders erreichten Energieversorger bereits nach wenigen Monaten signifikante Erfolge. \n\nÜber den reinen Lead‑Zuwachs hinaus ermöglichte die Plattform die gleichzeitige Verwaltung mehrerer Marken auf derselben Technologiebasis. Das spart Ressourcen, senkt Entwicklungskosten und gewährleistet konsistente Nutzererlebnisse dank einheitlichem Design System.\n\nMarketing-Teams kleiner und mittelgroßer EVUs profitieren dadurch enorm: Sie erhalten ein leistungsstarkes Tool, mit dem sie eigenständig digitale Buchungsstrecken gestalten und skalieren können - ohne dass hohe technische oder gestalterische Hürden überwunden werden müssen. Insgesamt resultiert das in gesteigerter Conversion, effizienteren Kampagnen und einer spürbaren Beschleunigung der digitalen Transformation im Energiesektor.","type":"cta","width":"","buttons":[],"headline":"Impact","component":"cta","fullWidth":true,"image_alt":"Screenshot der Webseite","textAlign":"left","colorNeutral":false,"contentAlign":"center","highlightText":true,"image_padding":false,"backgroundColor":"","order_mobileImageLast":false,"order_desktopImageLast":true}],"spaceAfter":"default","spaceBefore":"default","content_mode":"default","headline_sub":"","content_align":"center","content_width":"unset","headerSpacing":false,"headline_text":"","content_gutter":"default","headline_align":"","headline_large":false,"headline_width":"unset","backgroundColor":"default","content_tileWidth":"default","headline_textAlign":"","headline_switchOrder":false},{"_uid":"d735542d-2977-474a-945c-3ee8ed975851","type":"section","style":"","width":"wide","buttons":[],"inverted":false,"component":"section","spotlight":false,"components":[{"_uid":"d279bdf3-9ce9-4d71-b753-39477e5245e1","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x810/e5b08059cf/projekte_teaser_telekom.png","label":"","layout":"row","target":"case-studies/deutsche-telekom-exklusivpartner-web-baukasten","headline":"Telekom modularer Website Baukasten","component":"teaser-card","imageRatio":"unset","button_label":"Zum Showcase","button_hidden":true,"button_chevron":false},{"_uid":"65b279e6-0697-4328-8d94-9f0d6652ad90","text":"","type":"teaser-card","image":"https://a.storyblok.com/f/297364/1080x810/75a4143d37/wolfcraft_teaser_4zu3.jpg","label":""